{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a44938763984465210057461abed92323435fb987799b997ac9eb4edd2f406bc", "ja": "（美也が朝の情報番組に出演する事になり、TV局との\n打ち合わせが続いている。今日は更に、追加で……）", "zh": "（美也要出演早间资讯节目，所以一直在和电视台开会商量。今天还要追加……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1001_se", "source_sha256": "9bcabd031b0ee079a2b4c3e7973b5036bfa7d09eb44dd4e45971561142189a34", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ！", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cf6d8bc6b02595455c687088715c889bacaa76ad652d80244b5358954d3e7404", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "268a74d20340b6cd178569089d316896dec8b6f5e1d1e576ee775a4bac9ea0e0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nおお……ぴったり10分前、さすがですな～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～\n哦哦……刚好提前了10分钟，真不愧是您呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1004_p", "source_sha256": "60b9eb6337111911632ccfa4fd774a5993911bf30f338de9455d780f5ce22bcc", "ja": "急いだからな！　ええと、\n来てるのは亜利沙とこのみさんと……。", "zh": "因为我赶过来了啊！话说回来，\n到场的有亚利沙、木实小姐，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "d23a7ad930f73e904272d51250a2d453a2abf1417dd968acfa437d70faeedac7", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いしますっ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！  \n也请您多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "970a51bc9123b43abc9fffb5930e98308ff4bb9f9384f16a6131786f65e20f36", "ja": "今、美也ちゃんの新しいお仕事の話をしていたの。\nすごいじゃない、朝の情報番組なんて！", "zh": "刚才正在聊美也的新工作。很厉害嘛，居然是早间资讯节目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1007_p", "source_sha256": "462401c518570607d9997e73d0611b7cd631b939d474bbe2dec79477735c60a6", "ja": "そうなんです。それについて、\n実は追加の話があって……。", "zh": "是的。关于这件事，其实还有个补充消息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "31641271d79982f1c1f8e8b65a1f0b65010055530df4302e8a5b301255eeb982", "ja": "追加の話、ですか～？", "zh": "后续还有故事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b7e6f0281eac28d8c8a50f4f60141431a23a4d32f8ec2f7aa73a044d39285a64", "ja": "うん。でも話すなら、\n全員揃ってからの方が……あ。", "zh": "嗯。不过要说的话，\n还是等大家到齐了再……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1010_se", "source_sha256": "9bcabd031b0ee079a2b4c3e7973b5036bfa7d09eb44dd4e45971561142189a34", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ！", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "e23a52c2a773c4335d6579274bb6bed8478d9d5e813888e43f986414cc295af4", "ja": "おーっす！　……って、みんな早いなー！？\nてっきり、オレが一番乗りだと思ったのに。", "zh": "早上好！……等等，大家都来得好早啊——！？\n我还以为自己会是第一个到的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "ea9a901813bf1b23a3afd717f6f6d01ef9c3dc505609a493047f17b69be689df", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n待たせてしまって、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "大家、{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n让你们久等了，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "513c0f5cb0de1211483e70a9c1fa02daa705d2be035bada54ff0fe799b808a7e", "ja": "昴ちゃん、千早さん、お待ちしてました～。\nでも、そんなに待ってませんでしたよ～？", "zh": "昴、千早，我在等你们哦～。\n不过，也没等多久啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "ed6b57e66065153a7aa108ad580a416f76c88cbd8cb2da47267a1cc55d098ead", "ja": "待ってたけど待ってない……んん？\nなんかややこしいな！", "zh": "等了但又没等……嗯？\n总觉得好复杂啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "c870d11a9a2b069b347baafaa6794fd31b22322231a03a9f2f843fb18040b36f", "ja": "つまり、私たちはふたりを待っていたけど、\n遅刻はしていないから問題ない！ってことよ♪", "zh": "也就是说，我们虽然一直在等你们两个，\n但你们没有迟到，所以没问题！就是这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "8bb10802baeed4d608cfe418d06ea31f3ff21fac579cbe6b92c4a0cd10708d2f", "ja": "そのとおりです～。\nこのみさん、ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "就是这样～。\n谢谢你，木实～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1017_p", "source_sha256": "364b7396d476c5df4a551a64ab263a46b5fb791120fe757cc3991e41a293f663", "ja": "それじゃ、早速だけど定期公演の\nミーティングを始めるぞ！　と、その前に……。", "zh": "那么，马上开始定期公演的会议！不过在那之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f85a3795b7e23a6891b1ec4722a7f38c0e0794280987eaeae1effe72fd34dab2", "ja": "もう知っている人もいると思うけど。\n今度、美也が朝の情報番組に出演する事になった。", "zh": "我想应该已经有人知道了。\n美也接下来要去出演早间资讯节目了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "74249a1169edc25462a878ed331190080ca005a589b2572169b8b95cbbca197a", "ja": "ええっ、マジで！？　やったじゃん美也！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？太好了，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "20283597b7f0ef45902a572b52cf367e8f763ea87d3d0c217e1ce636d430f487", "ja": "朝の情報番組……すごいわ。\n宮尾さん、おめでとう。", "zh": "早间资讯节目……真了不起。\n宫尾同学，恭喜你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "105d3b52feaf5e6013590c4e586c46e49eb2da25cc3446b3cb903f84e819b4e2", "ja": "むふふ、ありがとうございます～。\n1ヶ月の、期間限定レギュラーですけどね～。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你～  \n虽然只是为期1个月的限时常驻嘉宾～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "00da4a89b5832229b2c7770651959fee503bab1c90891ce8364d9e3db130444b", "ja": "1ヶ月でもすごいって！　朝ならオレ、\n兄ちゃんたちといっしょに見られるしな♪", "zh": "就算只有1个月也很厉害啊！早上播的话，\n我就能和哥哥们一起看了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fb0ea3532df25fccf0d1caf2ee4c75b034956c3e4a65930edf87559f122e4fd1", "ja": "今回は番組ディレクターさんの推薦だそうだ。\n美也なら、幅広い層にリーチできそうだからって。", "zh": "听说这次是节目导演推荐的。\n因为如果是美也，似乎能吸引各个年龄层的观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1024_p", "source_sha256": "00758835595ef5dd3ce3f5f339676c3b24f3615977df28838aa7938738e48acd", "ja": "美也のこれまでの仕事も知ってくれていて、\n出演期間はお天気コーナーを任せてもらえるらしい。", "zh": "对美也之前的工作也有所了解，据说在出演期间，还会把天气预报环节交给她负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "d9953369d3896fcc508c81853ffed8b57c2661d0088e27bede157c54917d2f5b", "ja": "おおっ、それはお目が高い！　美也ちゃんは前にも、\nお天気リポーターのお仕事をしてますもんね！", "zh": "哦哦，真有眼光！美也以前也做过天气预报员的工作嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "502fadf93d68e820291736dbc1b59bf8687dd095ae6b15f1b0562e3d7be031a6", "ja": "そうなんです～。お仕事を評価してもらえて、\nとってもうれしいですな～。", "zh": "就是这样～！能得到认可，我真的非常开心呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1027_p", "source_sha256": "88f782d2410b562ce4c1c72d6c640643a81805dfebbbd45bab942f9ce58903f6", "ja": "今回は、1ヶ月なんだけど……評判が良ければ、\n編成期にレギュラー入りも検討してくれるそうだ。", "zh": "这次虽然只有1个月……不过听说如果反响好的话，到了编排期还会考虑让你加入常驻阵容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "9579695d7303b653697ac35ddb48b458825d4018532eadb124d6c22582c00e1e", "ja": "レギュラー！？　すっげー！\n美也、売れっ子になっちゃうんじゃないか！？", "zh": "常驻！？太棒了！\n美也该不会要变成大红人了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1029_p", "source_sha256": "11538bf0ea4ad8102a63b4c00fef1113f7128028f08bfbe19855c15bc97974b2", "ja": "それで、出演最終日に、\n定期公演の宣伝をさせてもらえるんだけど……。", "zh": "而且，在最后一次演出当天，还能让我们宣传定期公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1030_p", "source_sha256": "251036ef073bceb7badb23ef14de390cc77e9cd97f403b4f0f63745e502fe490", "ja": "せっかくだから、定期公演に出演するみんなで\n歌わないかって。さっき連絡があったんだ。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，所以刚才联系我说，要不要让参加定期公演的大家一起唱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "ab9dfbe17d82453d83a46ef400aaed49b3a2b984fac977a4fc4f6c51e6700054", "ja": "私たちも、ですか？", "zh": "我们也要参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "a01e488a6c76ccfcfcf3593aaaef3f2f00b8bf276fc616d7edbc0a986c3831d9", "ja": "アイドルが、朝の情報番組で生歌唱……！\nこれは話題になりますよぉ！", "zh": "偶像要在早间资讯节目中现场演唱……！\n这肯定会成为话题的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "b8a3c7054e2c0837d6e967f6b0ebaee9b88db69e6d48b4b0496130144b2f1ea1", "ja": "なんと～。\nもしかしてそれが、追加の話ですか～？", "zh": "居然～。\n难道那就是追加的工作吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1034_p", "source_sha256": "aa9b838162645b96d0bce65ae1afdf9f95fe812d3b8fa0c1ae8b4beb5d9b6325", "ja": "そうだ。全国放送の番組だし、\nこちらとしては願ってもない事なんだけど……。", "zh": "没错。毕竟是全国播出的节目，对我们来说真是求之不得，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "78530a28d8a0cb73d1c94f539365bc3e2e9b6a137db6da53b790d5ee788f07f4", "ja": "朝の情報番組って、入りがとにかく早いものね……。\nでも、任せて！　お姉さん、早起き頑張るわ！", "zh": "早间资讯节目，到场时间可是特别早的呢……\n不过，交给我吧！姐姐我会努力早起的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "2a50212ffa2c2f310d433d98428c1e3157195fb15ae832e5c328ef67b26207bc", "ja": "スケジュール的には……定期公演より早いんですね。\n宮尾さんが、忙しくなりそうですが……。", "zh": "从日程上来说……比定期公演还要早呢。\n宫尾小姐可能会忙起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_162_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "d20b17f957c74c32f394a1cd890edab6b8944072dc98cb6f33b91fdaa5f5ae50", "ja": "私なら、大丈夫ですよ～。\n早起きも忙しいのも、どんとこいです～。", "zh": "我嘛，没问题哦～。\n早起和忙碌什么的，尽管来吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
